{"type":"text","timestamp":1788461161084,"sessionID":"ses_f9768840fffeIxAY7c6BMSjHWG","part":{"id":"prt_068979504001fFgD9Gix27dzeS","messageID":"msg_068979409001S5YnPyqt19Qzp1","sessionID":"ses_f9768840fffeIxAY7c6BMSjHWG","type":"text","text":"I can see the issue now. The current implementation of `CeilDiv` simply performs integer division (`a / b`), which truncates towards zero rather than rounding up. The function should round up to the nearest integer (ceiling) when dividing two integers.\n\nLet me fix the implementation:\n\n","time":{"start":1788461159684,"end":1788461161077}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788461161084,"sessionID":"ses_f9768840fffeIxAY7c6BMSjHWG","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"v016Z0ZKFCfTtZ7ZimG4teLrYlpJxHjS","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-m55t1ep1\\repair.go","oldString":"package repair\n\nfunc CeilDiv(a, b int) int { return a / b }","newString":"package repair\n\nfunc CeilDiv(a, b int) int { \n    if a < 0 || b <= 0 {\n        panic(\"a must be nonnegative and b must be positive\")\n    }\n    return (a + b - 1) / b\n}"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-m55t1ep1\\repair.go\n===================================================================\n--- C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-m55t1ep1\\repair.go\n+++ C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-m55t1ep1\\repair.go\n@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@\n package repair\n \n-func CeilDiv(a, b int) int { return a / b }\n+func CeilDiv(a, b int) int { \n+    if a < 0 || b <= 0 {\n+        panic(\"a must be nonnegative and b must be positive\")\n+    }\n+    return (a + b - 1) / b\n+}\n","filediff":{"file":"C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-m55t1ep1\\repair.go","patch":"Index: C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-m55t1ep1\\repair.go\n===================================================================\n--- C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-m55t1ep1\\repair.go\n+++ C:\\Users\\flowc\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\forge-opencode-m55t1ep1\\repair.go\n@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@\n package repair\n \n-func CeilDiv(a, b int) int { return a / b }\n+func CeilDiv(a, b int) int { \n+    if a < 0 || b <= 0 {\n+        panic(\"a must be nonnegative and b must be positive\")\n+    }\n+    return (a + b - 1) / b\n+}\n","additions":6,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"repair.go","time":{"start":1788461161079,"end":1788461161083}},"id":"prt_0689796e4001UiwRjQpPw62ozs","sessionID":"ses_f9768840fffeIxAY7c6BMSjHWG","messageID":"msg_068979409001S5YnPyqt19Qzp1"}}
