{"type":"text","timestamp":1788461165112,"sessionID":"ses_f9768840fffeIxAY7c6BMSjHWG","part":{"id":"prt_06897a4770019sGGPAa0kKQdPs","messageID":"msg_06897a30c001oH9BYM0i5D23XE","sessionID":"ses_f9768840fffeIxAY7c6BMSjHWG","type":"text","text":"The test passes, which means our fix is working correctly. Let me also verify the logic with the test cases:\n\n1. `CeilDiv(0, 3)` should return `0` → (0 + 3 - 1) / 3 = 2 / 3 = 0 ✓\n2. `CeilDiv(1, 3)` should return `1` → (1 + 3 - 1) / 3 = 3 / 3 = 1 ✓\n3. `CeilDiv(6, 3)` should return `2` → (6 + 3 - 1) / 3 = 8 / 3 = 2 ✓\n4. `CeilDiv(7, 3)` should return `3` → (7 + 3 - 1) / 3 = 9 / 3 = 3 ✓\n\nThe fix correctly implements ceiling division for non-negative integers divided by positive integers.","time":{"start":1788461163639,"end":1788461165110}}}
